---
import Pic from '../Pic.astro';
import original from '../../assets/img/ui-fx-loop.jpg';
---
<figure class="fx-original-flow">
  <a class="diagram-image" href={original.src} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open the complete original FX decision loop image in a new tab">
    <Pic name="ui-fx-loop.jpg" alt="Original FX decision loop: watch order progress and fill prices, assess schedule and benchmarks, then remain passive or intervene. The complete branches are transcribed below." />
  </a>
  <figcaption>Original design exploration · The decision loop · <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/17Rsi3vWFtaYwlrRf5iO8E/Interview-Presentation-2026?node-id=2068-1681" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the Figma source<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span> ↗</a></figcaption>
  <details>
    <summary>Read the decision loop</summary>
    <div class="flow-transcript">
      <p><strong>Working Order Live → Watch the canvas.</strong> % done vs schedule, fills vs market.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>% Done On Schedule?</strong> On schedule → Watch the canvas. Behind → Avg Fill Inside Benchmarks (ARR · TWAP)?</li>
        <li><strong>Acceptable → Stay Passive:</strong> let resting limits work → keep working → Watch the canvas.</li>
        <li><strong>Adverse → How To Intervene?</strong> Reprice: drag the limit line. Stage an order: drag the BID pill. Fill now: take liquidity. Cross-filter venues: exclude poor fills. Each leads to Filled, Post-Trade Review.</li>
        <li><strong>Hatched Band On:</strong> delayed, suspended, or outside limit → Reprice, Or Accept The Wait → keep watching. Session ends → Cutoff, Fill Now, Or Carry The Risk.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>
</figure>
<style>
  .fx-original-flow { margin: 0 0 32px; min-width: 0; }
  .diagram-image { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 1008px; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  .diagram-image :global(picture) { display: block; width: 100%; }
  .diagram-image :global(img) { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: none; aspect-ratio: auto; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 0; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-2); }
  details { margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hair); padding-top: 16px; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  .flow-transcript { padding-top: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .flow-transcript ul { padding-left: 1.3em; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .flow-transcript li { display: list-item; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; }
</style>
